.buckconfig.ci
third-party/.cargo/
# Reindeer vendored crate sources — generated by `reindeer vendor`, downloaded at
# build time via http_archive. Only the ece fork (third-party/ece-2.3.1-rustcrypto/)
# is tracked; all other crate sources are downloaded with sha256 verification.
third-party/vendor/
